<AuthLayout title="Join the creator beta" lead="The private beta is being coordinated directly while account storage remains disabled."><div class="auth-form"><p>Send a short note with your creator or publication name and the affiliate networks you use. HonorCart will reply with availability and next steps.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:beta@honorcart.com?subject=HonorCart%20creator%20beta">Email the beta team</a><p class="form-note">HonorCart does not collect your details through this page. Your email provider handles the message you choose to send.</p></div><p class="auth-switch"><a href="/privacy">Read the privacy policy</a></p></AuthLayout>
